    "field_description": [
        {
            "value": "Drupal exposes a lot of data that a decoupled app can consume, but in most cases it is limited to content rather than configuration; site title, slogan, logo among others are not readily available on a JSON:API build. Today I'll be looking at the Config Pages module for Drupal, and the newly released Druxt companion module."
        }
    ],
